graph TD
    A[CLI Command] -->|Sends file path| B[Orchestrator]
    B -->|1. Creates| C(PEContext)
    C -.->|Loads PE Data| D[(File on Disk)]
    B -->|2. Asks PluginManager| E[Plugin Manager]
    E -.->|Returns ordered list| F{Detectors Pipeline}
    
    F -->|Detector 1| G(Section Detector)
    F -->|Detector 2| H(Entropy Detector)
    F -->|Detector 3| I(YARA / Signatures)
    F -->|Detector N| J(Other Detectors...)
    
    G & H & I & J -->|Updates| C
    
    F -->|Runs Last| K((Heuristic Detector))
    K -.->|Reads all previous results| C
    K -->|Calculates Final Score| C
    
    C -->|3. Extracts Verdict| B
    B -->|4. Unpack if needed| L[Unpackers]
    B -->|5. Generate Output| M[Reporters]
    M --> N[JSON/HTML Report]
